text: ["A player who controls more permanents than each other player can't play lands or cast artifact, creature, or enchantment spells. That player may sacrifice a permanent for that player to ignore this effect until end of turn.", "All creatures have vigilance.\nAt the beginning of each player's end step, tap all untapped creatures that player controls that didn't attack this turn. Angel's Trumpet deals damage to the player equal to the number of creatures tapped this way.", 'All permanents are colorless.', 'Anthroplasm enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it.\n{X}, {T}: Remove all +1/+1 counters from Anthroplasm and put X +1/+1 counters on it.', 'As Engineered Plague enters the battlefield, choose a creature type.\nAll creatures of the chosen type get -1/-1.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a land.\nSearch your library for a land card, put that card onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice an artifact.\nSearch your library for an artifact card, put that card onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', "At the beginning of each opponent's upkeep, Iron Maiden deals X damage to that player, where X is the number of cards in their hand minus 4.", "At the beginning of each opponent's upkeep, Wheel of Torture deals X damage to that player, where X is 3 minus the number of cards in their hand.", "At the beginning of each player's upkeep, if that player controls more lands than each other player, Rivalry deals 2 damage to them.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, each opponent loses 1 life. You gain life equal to the life lost this way.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if an opponent controls three or more creatures, sacrifice Defense of the Heart, search your library for up to two creature cards, put those cards onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', "At the beginning of your upkeep, if there are four or more creatures on the battlefield, sacrifice Planar Collapse and destroy all creatures. They can't be regenerated.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if there are seven or more lands on the battlefield, sacrifice Impending Disaster and destroy all lands.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if you have 5 or less life, sacrifice Second Chance and take an extra turn after this one.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if you have no cards in hand, sacrifice Brink of Madness and target opponent discards their hand.', "Beast of Burden's power and toughness are each equal to the number of creatures on the battlefield.", "Bouncing Beebles can't be blocked as long as defending player controls an artifact.", 'Choose one —\n• Parch deals 2 damage to any target.\n• Parch deals 4 damage to target blue creature.', 'Counter target spell that targets a creature.', 'Counter target spell unless its controller pays {2}.\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Creatures you control have first strike.', 'Creatures you control have flying.', 'Destroy all artifacts and enchantments.', 'Destroy target creature with flying.', 'Destroy target creature with power 2 or less.\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Destroy target creature with power 4 or greater.\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Destroy two target artifacts.', 'Destroy two target enchantments.', 'Draw two cards, then discard two cards. Untap up to three lands.', "Each spell costs {3} more to cast except during its controller's turn.", 'Echo {2}{G} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\nWhen Yavimaya Granger enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'Echo {2}{R} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\nWhen Ghitu Slinger enters the battlefield, it deals 2 damage to any target.', 'Echo {3} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\nSacrifice Ticking Gnomes: It deals 1 damage to any target.', 'Echo {3} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\n{1}, {T}: Tap target artifact, creature, or land.', 'Echo {3}{G}{G} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\nWhen Deranged Hermit enters the battlefield, create four 1/1 green Squirrel creature tokens.\nSquirrel creatures get +1/+1.', "Echo {3}{W} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\nWhen Radiant's Dragoons enters the battlefield, you gain 5 life.", 'Echo {4} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\nThran War Machine attacks each combat if able.', 'Echo {4} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\nYou may choose not to untap Thran Weaponry during your untap step.\n{2}, {T}: All creatures get +2/+2 for as long as Thran Weaponry remains tapped.', 'Echo {6} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\n{T}: Draw a card.', "Echo {G}{G} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\nWhen Multani's Acolyte enters the battlefield, draw a card.", 'Enchant creature\nAll damage that would be dealt to enchanted creature is dealt to its controller instead.', "Enchant creature\nAt the beginning of the upkeep of enchanted creature's controller, that player sacrifices that creature unless they pay {2}.\nWhen Slow Motion is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, return Slow Motion to its owner's hand.", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature can't attack.\nWhen Cessation is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, return Cessation to its owner's hand.", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature can't block.\nWhen Sluggishness is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, return Sluggishness to its owner's hand.", 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+0 for each Mountain you control.', "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+0 and has trample.\nWhen Rancor is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, return Rancor to its owner's hand.", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature has fear. (It can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)\nWhen Sleeper's Guile is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, return Sleeper's Guile to its owner's hand.", 'Exile target enchantment.', "Faerie Conclave enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {U}.\n{1}{U}: Faerie Conclave becomes a 2/1 blue Faerie creature with flying until end of turn. It's still a land.", 'Flash\nEcho {2}{G} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)', 'Flash\nProtection from red', 'Flash\nProtection from white', 'Flying\nEcho {2}{B} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\nWhen Bone Shredder enters the battlefield, destroy target nonartifact, nonblack creature.', 'Flying\nEcho {2}{U} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\nWhen Raven Familiar enters the battlefield, look at the top three cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', 'Flying\nWhen Cloud of Faeries enters the battlefield, untap up to two lands.\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', "Flying\nWhen Palinchron enters the battlefield, untap up to seven lands.\n{2}{U}{U}: Return Palinchron to its owner's hand.", "Flying\nWhen Shivan Phoenix dies, return Shivan Phoenix to its owner's hand.", 'Flying\nWhenever Sustainer of the Realm blocks, it gets +0/+2 until end of turn.', 'Flying\nWhenever Tethered Skirge becomes the target of a spell or ability, you lose 1 life.', 'Flying\n{2}{U}: Untap Vigilant Drake.', 'Flying\n{B}: Regenerate Fog of Gnats.', 'Flying\n{T}, Sacrifice Phyrexian Debaser: Target creature gets -2/-2 until end of turn.', 'Flying\n{T}: Thornwind Faeries deals 1 damage to any target.', "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\n{1}{U}: Return Fleeting Image to its owner's hand.", 'Flying, protection from artifacts', 'Flying, protection from black\nEcho {3}{W}{W} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\nWhen Karmic Guide enters the battlefield, return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield.', 'Flying, protection from red', 'Flying, vigilance\nRadiant, Archangel gets +1/+1 for each other creature with flying on the battlefield.', "Forbidding Watchtower enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {W}.\n{1}{W}: Forbidding Watchtower becomes a 1/5 white Soldier creature until end of turn. It's still a land.", "Ghitu Encampment enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {R}.\n{1}{R}: Ghitu Encampment becomes a 2/1 red Warrior creature with first strike until end of turn. It's still a land. (It deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)", "Grim Monolith doesn't untap during your untap step.\n{T}: Add {C}{C}{C}.\n{4}: Untap Grim Monolith.", "Haste\nAt the beginning of the end step, return Viashino Cutthroat to its owner's hand.", 'Haste\nEcho {3}{R} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\nWhen Avalanche Riders enters the battlefield, destroy target land.', "Haste (This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)\nAt the beginning of the end step, return Viashino Sandscout to its owner's hand. (Return it only if it's on the battlefield.)", 'If Viashino Bey attacks, all creatures you control attack if able.', 'Lava Axe deals 5 damage to target player or planeswalker.', 'No more than two creatures can attack you each combat.', 'Other enchantments have "At the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice this enchantment unless you pay {2}."', 'Protection from artifacts', 'Protection from black\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Protection from blue\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Protection from white\nWhen Eviscerator enters the battlefield, you lose 5 life.', "Put all enchantments on top of their owners' libraries.", "Pygmy Pyrosaur can't block.\n{R}: Pygmy Pyrosaur gets +1/+0 until end of turn.", "Return all artifacts to their owners' hands.\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)", 'Return target creature card with mana value 3 or less from your graveyard to the battlefield.\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', "Return target creature to its owner's hand. Untap up to two lands.", 'Sacrifice a creature: The next time a source of your choice would deal damage to any target this turn, prevent that damage.', 'Sacrifice any number of creatures. Last-Ditch Effort deals that much damage to any target.', "Shroud (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities.)\nMultani, Maro-Sorcerer's power and toughness are each equal to the total number of cards in all players' hands.", "Shuffle all creature cards from target player's graveyard into that player's library.\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)", 'Spawning Pool enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {B}.\n{1}{B}: Spawning Pool becomes a 1/1 black Skeleton creature with "{B}: Regenerate this creature" until end of turn. It\'s still a land. (If it regenerates, the next time it would be destroyed this turn, it isn\'t. Instead tap it, remove all damage from it, and remove it from combat.)', "Swampwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Swamp.)", "Switch target creature's power and toughness until end of turn.", 'Target creature gets +0/+4 until end of turn.\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Target creature gets +1/+1 and gains reach until end of turn. (It can block creatures with flying.)', 'Target creature gets +7/+7 until end of turn.', 'Target opponent reveals their hand. You choose a creature card from it. That player discards that card.', 'Target player draws four cards.', "Trample\nWhen Weatherseed Treefolk dies, return it to its owner's hand.", "Trample (This creature can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)", "Treetop Village enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {G}.\n{1}{G}: Treetop Village becomes a 3/3 green Ape creature with trample until end of turn. It's still a land. (It can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)", 'Two target creatures each get -1/-1 until end of turn.', 'Untap target permanent.', 'Untap two target creatures. Each of them gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'When Delusions of Mediocrity enters the battlefield, you gain 10 life.\nWhen Delusions of Mediocrity leaves the battlefield, you lose 10 life.', 'When Rank and File enters the battlefield, green creatures get -1/-1 until end of turn.', "When a creature is put into an opponent's graveyard from the battlefield, if Lurking Skirge is an enchantment, Lurking Skirge becomes a 3/2 Phyrexian Imp creature with flying.", 'When an opponent casts a creature spell, if Opal Champion is an enchantment, Opal Champion becomes a 3/3 Knight creature with first strike.', 'When an opponent casts an instant spell, if Hidden Gibbons is an enchantment, Hidden Gibbons becomes a 4/4 Ape creature.', 'When you have 10 or less life, if Opal Avenger is an enchantment, Opal Avenger becomes a 3/5 Soldier creature.', 'Whenever Gang of Elk becomes blocked, it gets +2/+2 until end of turn for each creature blocking it.', 'Whenever Goblin Medics becomes tapped, it deals 1 damage to any target.', 'Whenever Treefolk Mystic blocks or becomes blocked by a creature, destroy all Auras attached to that creature.', 'Whenever a creature deals damage to you, destroy it.', "Whenever a spell you've cast is countered, draw a card.", 'Whenever an artifact or enchantment is put into your graveyard from the battlefield, you gain 1 life.', 'You gain 3 life for each creature attacking you.', "You may have Lone Wolf assign its combat damage as though it weren't blocked.", '{1}, Sacrifice a creature: Put a +1/+1 counter on Phyrexian Broodlings.', '{1}{B}, Pay 2 life: Return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', "{1}{R}, {T}: Destroy target artifact. Viashino Heretic deals damage to that artifact's controller equal to the artifact's mana value.", '{1}{R}{R}: Put a +1/+1 counter on Molten Hydra.\n{T}, Remove all +1/+1 counters from Molten Hydra: It deals damage to any target equal to the number of +1/+1 counters removed this way.', "{1}{U}, {T}: Put target green creature on top of its owner's library.", '{2}: Regenerate target artifact creature.', '{3}, Discard a card at random: Pyromancy deals damage to any target equal to the mana value of the discarded card.', '{4}, {T}: You may put a creature card from your hand onto the battlefield.', '{R}: Target creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', '{T}, Sacrifice Expendable Troops: It deals 2 damage to target attacking or blocking creature.', '{T}, Sacrifice Ghitu Fire-Eater: It deals damage equal to its power to any target.', '{T}, Sacrifice Memory Jar: Each player exiles all cards from their hand face down and draws seven cards. At the beginning of the next end step, each player discards their hand and returns to their hand each card they exiled this way.', '{T}, Sacrifice Phyrexian Defiler: Target creature gets -3/-3 until end of turn.', '{T}, Sacrifice Phyrexian Denouncer: Target creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.', '{T}, Sacrifice Phyrexian Plaguelord: Target creature gets -4/-4 until end of turn.\nSacrifice a creature: Target creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.', '{T}, Sacrifice Tragic Poet: Return target enchantment card from your graveyard to your hand.', "{T}: Choose target artifact a player controls and target artifact card in that player's graveyard. If both targets are still legal as this ability resolves, that player simultaneously sacrifices the artifact and returns the artifact card to the battlefield.", '{T}: Destroy target Aura attached to a creature.', '{T}: Draw a card.', "{T}: Target creature gains forestwalk until end of turn. (It can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Forest.)", '{T}: Target creature loses your choice of flying, first strike, or trample until end of turn.', '{T}: Target creature you control gains protection from the color of your choice until end of turn.']
